1
00:00:00,962 --> 00:00:02,002
(Sheldon(entering):)Go away?

2
00:00:04,465 --> 00:00:05,675
(Leonard(in a Yoda voice):)Hmm.

3
00:00:06,217 --> 00:00:07,257
(Sheldon(entering):)Could it be me?

4
00:00:11,472 --> 00:00:12,512
(Penny(opening door):)Hey, guys, what's up?

5
00:00:12,682 --> 00:00:16,142
We need a hot 15-year-old Asian girl
with a thing for smart guys.

6
00:00:17,061 --> 00:00:18,691
(Leonard:)- What?
- Howard, that's racist.

7
00:00:18,855 --> 00:00:22,525
Any 15-year-old girl will do the trick.

8
00:00:27,822 --> 00:00:31,322
(Raj:)It's possible
she may have misunderstood us.

9
00:00:35,163 --> 00:00:36,663
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

10
00:00:36,998 --> 00:00:40,168
- Dr. Cooper. Oh, are we interrupting?
- No, no, please come in.

11
00:00:40,334 --> 00:00:42,834
(Sheldon:)I think you'll appreciate this.
This is very exciting.

12
00:00:43,004 --> 00:00:45,174
(Gablehouser:)- What are you working on?
- Something remarkable.

13
00:00:45,339 --> 00:00:49,679
(Sheldon:)Since my prospects for the Nobel Prize
in Physics have disappeared... Thank you.

14
00:00:49,844 --> 00:00:53,264
(Sheldon:)...I've decided to refocus my efforts
and use my people skills...

15
00:00:53,431 --> 00:00:54,931
(Sheldon:)...to win the Nobel Peace Prize.

16
00:00:55,099 --> 00:00:57,559
(Sheldon:)Look, I'm going
to solve the Middle East crisis...

